      "expect": {
        "on": {"record": true, "outcome": "done"},
        "off": {"record": true, "outcome": "done"}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "outcome-enum-coverage-pending",
      "rules": ["data_change_default_done"],
      "anchor": "数据修改类特例",
      "why": "补齐 outcome 枚举里 pending 的**开态**出现路径（其余触点在 data-change-default-done 的关态）：数据修改类、我方只回安抚「再看看」⇒ 开时默认完成、关时未确认完成。",
